msgstr ""
"Pengatur modiator: ruang kunci, matikan semua, matikan semua kamera, dan "
"hapus peserta"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/live/landing_live/features.html.heex:530
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "NickServ and ChanServ-style registration and access control."
msgstr "NickServ dan Chand- gaya pendaftaran dan kontrol akses."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/live/landing_live/features.html.heex:336
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "No gameplay server — synced through the private P2P session"
msgstr "Tidak ada server gameplay - disinkronkan melalui sesi P2P pribadi"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/live/landing_live/faq.html.heex:65
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "No. Private 1:1 calls are P2P, but channel conferences use a self-hosted SFU/room server. Each browser sends media to your server, and your server routes streams to the other participants. That makes group calls practical while keeping infrastructure under your control."
msgstr ""
"Tidak. Panggilan pribadi 1: 1 adalah P2P, tapi konferensi saluran "
"menggunakan SFU sendiri yang diselenggarakan/room server. Setiap peramban "
"mengirim media ke server Anda, dan rute server Anda mengalir ke peserta "
"lain. Yang membuat panggilan kelompok praktis sementara menjaga "
"infrastruktur di bawah kendalimu."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/live/landing_live/faq.html.heex:110
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "On Discord, your data lives on their servers and your communities can be removed at any time. On Retro Hex Chat, you control your server and database, private sessions can run directly between users via P2P, channel conferences run on your own infrastructure, and the code is open source — you can audit every line."
msgstr ""
"Pada Discord, data Anda tinggal di server mereka dan komunitas Anda dapat "
"dihapus setiap saat. Pada Retro Hex Chat, Anda mengendalikan server dan "
"basis data, sesi pribadi dapat berjalan langsung antara pengguna melalui "
"P2P, konferensi saluran berjalan pada infrastruktur Anda sendiri, dan kode "
"adalah open source - Anda dapat audit setiap baris."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/live/landing_live/how_it_works.html.heex:221
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Operators can lock the room, mute participants, disable cameras, manage screen sharing, or end the conference."
msgstr ""
"Operator dapat mengunci ruangan, peserta bisu, mematikan kamera, mengelola "
"berbagi layar, atau mengakhiri konferensi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/live/landing_live/features.html.heex:589
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Over 50 commands with smart autocomplete."
msgstr "Lebih dari 50 perintah dengan autocomplete cerdas."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/live/landing_live/faq.html.heex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "P2P (peer-to-peer) means data goes directly between users without passing through the chat server. Retro Hex Chat uses WebRTC P2P for private calls, file transfers, and multiplayer game sessions. The server helps users find each other (signaling), then the private session runs browser-to-browser when the network allows it."
msgstr ""
"P2P (peer-to-peer) berarti data akan langsung antara pengguna tanpa melewati"
" server obrolan. Retro Hex Chat menggunakan WebRTC P2P untuk panggilan "
"pribadi, transfer file, dan sesi game multiplayer. Server membantu pengguna "
"menemukan satu sama lain (sinyal), maka sesi pribadi menjalankan browser- "
"to-browser ketika jaringan mengizinkannya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/live/landing_live/community.html.heex:140
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Phoenix Channels, PubSub"
msgstr "Phoenix Channels, PubSub"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/live/landing_live/how_it_works.html.heex:52
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "PostgreSQL keeps the data accessible for your own backup and migration strategy."
msgstr ""
"PostgreSQL menyimpan data yang dapat diakses untuk strategi backup dan "
"migrasi anda sendiri."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/live/landing_live/features.html.heex:200
